You can use ﬁlters to reﬁne your semantic search results. To create an index and perform a ﬁltered
search on your documents, substitute Upload and search data in the previous tutorial with the
following instructions. The other steps remain the same. For more information about ﬁlters, see k-
NN search with ﬁlters.
To index and search data in the movies collection
1.
To create a single index for your collection, send the following request in the Dev Tools
console:
PUT housing-index-filtered
{
"settings": {
"index.knn": true
},
"mappings": {
"properties": {
"housing-vector": {
"type": "knn_vector",
"dimension": 3,
"method": {
"engine": "faiss",
"name": "hnsw"
}
},
"title": {
"type": "text"
},
