"price": {
"type": "long"
},
"location": {
"type": "geo_point"
}
}
}
}
2.
To index a single document into housing-index-ﬁltered, send the following request:
POST housing-index-filtered/_doc
{
"housing-vector": [
10,
20,
30
],
"title": "2 bedroom in downtown Seattle",
"price": "2800",
"location": "47.71, 122.00"
}
3.
To search your data for an apartment in Seattle under a given price and within a given distance
of a geographical point, send the following request:
GET housing-index-filtered/_search
{
"size": 5,
"query": {
"knn": {
"housing-vector": {
"vector": [
0.1,
0.2,
0.3
],
"k": 5,
"filter": {
"bool": {
"must": [
